1
00:00:00,591 --> 00:00:03,296
Mesin sebesar truk ini tidak menyemprot beton.

2
00:00:03,461 --> 00:00:06,145
Ia memerasnya seperti pasta gigi,

3
00:00:06,165 --> 00:00:07,580
lapis demi lapis.

4
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:10,987
Semua dimulai dari model tiga dimensi.

5
00:00:11,152 --> 00:00:13,006
Software memotongnya menjadi lapisan

6
00:00:13,026 --> 00:00:14,808
tipis dan jalur gerak kepala cetak.

7
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:16,659
Fondasinya tetap dicor dengan cara biasa.

8
00:00:17,149 --> 00:00:20,007
Mortar khusus dicampur dan dipompa lewat selang.

9
00:00:20,172 --> 00:00:22,696
Nozzle memeras tali beton setebal satu

10
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,223
sampai empat sentimeter,

11
00:00:24,546 --> 00:00:25,611
mengelilingi denah,

12
00:00:25,704 --> 00:00:27,058
lalu naik satu lapis.

13
00:00:27,249 --> 00:00:29,972
Rahasianya, adonan cair saat dipompa,

14
00:00:29,992 --> 00:00:32,153
tapi langsung kaku setelah keluar,

15
00:00:32,173 --> 00:00:35,399
sehingga kuat menahan lapisan di atasnya tanpa cetakan.

16
00:00:35,889 --> 00:00:38,029
Dindingnya sering dicetak berongga,

17
00:00:38,126 --> 00:00:40,539
dua kulit dengan penghubung zigzag.

18
00:00:40,704 --> 00:00:43,718
Rongga itu lalu diisi insulasi,

19
00:00:43,825 --> 00:00:45,650
besi, atau kabel.

20
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:48,614
Tapi jam cetak bukan rumah jadi.

21
00:00:49,103 --> 00:00:51,461
Di Beckum, Jerman, dindingnya dicetak

22
00:00:51,481 --> 00:00:53,092
seratus jam, sedangkan atap,

23
00:00:53,112 --> 00:00:55,990
jendela, dan instalasi tetap dipasang pekerja.

24
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:57,840
Printernya mencetak dinding,

25
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,077
bukan seluruh rumah.

26
00:00:59,247 --> 00:01:00,980
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
